@startuml
title Book Room - Smart Campus Study Room Booking

actor Student
participant BookingService
database BookingRepository

Student -> BookingService: bookRoom(roomId, startTime, endTime)
activate BookingService

BookingService -> BookingService: validate Rules (R1: future start & duration 0..2h, R3: room not blocked)

BookingService -> BookingRepository: checkOverlap(roomId, startTime, endTime)
activate BookingRepository
BookingRepository --> BookingService: overlap result (R2)
deactivate BookingRepository

alt Rules valid and room available
    BookingService -> BookingRepository: saveBooking(studentId, roomId, startTime, endTime)
    activate BookingRepository
    BookingRepository --> BookingService: booking created
    deactivate BookingRepository

    BookingService --> Student: Booking confirmed (R4)

else Room unavailable or rules invalid
    BookingService --> Student: Room unavailable / booking rejected
    
    Student -> BookingService: requestAlternativeRooms(startTime, endTime)
    BookingService -> BookingRepository: findAvailableRooms(startTime, endTime)
    activate BookingRepository
    BookingRepository --> BookingService: available rooms
    deactivate BookingRepository

    BookingService --> Student: Alternative rooms returned
end

deactivate BookingService

note right of BookingService
Design component:
BookingService contains validation 
and application logic for R1-R4.
end note

note right of BookingRepository
Design component:
BookingRepository handles data persistence 
and queries existing bookings.
end note

note bottom
Assumptions:
1. Student is authenticated.
2. R1, R2, R3 validations happen before any persistence call.
3. No booking is created on failure branches.
end note

@enduml